          "v": "DHI, short for Direct Hair Implantation, is a hair transplant technique that is often compared with FUE. Both begin by taking follicles from a donor area. The difference lies mostly in how the grafts are placed. This guide explains how a DHI hair transplant works, who it may suit, what recovery looks like and what to ask a hair transplant surgeon or hair transplant specialist before you decide."
